## 🌐 URLs

- Use `app_name` for namespacing in every app's `urls.py`
- Use named URL patterns everywhere — never hardcode URLs
- Group related URLs logically with comments
- Include app URLs in the root `urls.py` under a logical prefix

```python
# apps/articles/urls.py
app_name = "articles"

urlpatterns = [
    path("", views.ArticleListView.as_view(), name="list"),
    path("<int:pk>/", views.ArticleDetailView.as_view(), name="detail"),
    path("create/", views.ArticleCreateView.as_view(), name="create"),
]
```

