## 🔐 Security

- Always keep `DEBUG = False` in production
- Set `SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT = True` in production
- Set `SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE = True` and `CSRF_COOKIE_SECURE = True`
- Set `X_FRAME_OPTIONS = "DENY"`
- Use `SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS`, `SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS`, and `SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD` in production
- Never expose tracebacks in production (`DEBUG = False` handles this)
- Use `django-axes` to rate-limit login attempts
- Validate and sanitize all user inputs via forms/serializers — never trust raw request data
- Avoid raw SQL queries; if needed, use parameterized queries only
- Use `{% csrf_token %}` in every POST form

