## 🛠️ Admin

- Register all models in `admin.py`
- Use `list_display`, `list_filter`, `search_fields`, and `ordering` in every `ModelAdmin`
- Use `readonly_fields` for auto-generated fields
- Use `inlines` for related models
- Override `get_queryset()` to optimize admin queries
- Never expose sensitive fields in admin without proper staff/superuser restrictions

```python
@admin.register(Article)
class ArticleAdmin(admin.ModelAdmin):
    list_display = ["title", "author", "created_at", "status"]
    list_filter = ["status", "created_at"]
    search_fields = ["title", "author__email"]
    readonly_fields = ["created_at", "updated_at"]
    ordering = ["-created_at"]
```

