## 📦 Dependencies & Tooling

### Recommended Packages
- `django-environ` or `python-decouple` — environment variable management
- `django-model-utils` — useful model mixins (`TimeStampedModel`, `StatusModel`)
- `django-crispy-forms` + `crispy-tailwind` or `crispy-bootstrap5` — form rendering
- `django-allauth` — authentication (social login, email verification)
- `django-axes` — brute-force login protection
- `django-debug-toolbar` — dev query inspection
- `celery` + `redis` — async task queue
- `django-storages` + `boto3` — S3 file storage (production)
- `whitenoise` — static file serving in production
- `sentry-sdk` — error monitoring in production
- `pytest-django` + `factory-boy` + `pytest-cov` — testing

### Code Quality Tools
- `ruff` — fast linter and formatter (replaces flake8 + isort + black)
- `mypy` + `django-stubs` — static type checking
- `pre-commit` — run linters before each commit

### pre-commit config example
```yaml
# .pre-commit-config.yaml
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit
    rev: v0.4.4
    hooks:
      - id: ruff
        args: [--fix]
      - id: ruff-format
  - repo: https://github.com/pre-commit/mirrors-mypy
    rev: v1.10.0
    hooks:
      - id: mypy
```

